+      "problem": "PUT /application/{app_name}/index/svn/{repo_name} (update_svn_index_application) defines its own process() closure that loads the index, creates the SVNDatasourceProcessor and runs oversized()/resume() without calling IndexInfo.stamp_reindex_triggered_at. The stamp was added only to SVNIndexService.reindex (svn_index_service.py:81), which is a different route reached via _repository_support.py:223. Unlike that closure, this one is live whenever skip_reindex is false.",
